  "intro": "This generator turns a rent revision into a dated written notice: it works out the revised monthly rent, the extra outgo per year, the proportionate security deposit and whether the effective date leaves enough notice. The three-month default follows Section 9(2) of the Model Tenancy Act, 2021, which requires a landlord to give written notice three months before the revised rent becomes due, and the deposit is checked against the Section 11(1) ceiling of two months' rent for residential premises and six months for non-residential premises. It is meant for individual landlords, property managers and tenants who want to check the notice they received.",
