      "Korean missions commonly apply a six-month reapplication restriction from the date of refusal, waived only where circumstances have materially changed - a new job, a new sponsor, a completed course or a resolved record. The exact wording is set by each mission, so read the notice from the one that refused you. Treat the next application as the only one you get for that period and build it completely."
